{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45596","headline":"渔家 · 贯休","name":"渔家","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赤芦盖屋低压恰，沙涨柴门水痕叠。\n黄鸡青犬花蒙笼，渔女渔儿扫风叶。\n有叟相逢带秋醉，自拔船桩色无媿。\n前山脚下得鱼多，恶浪堆中尽头睡。\n但得忘筌心自乐，肯羡前贤钓清渭。\n终须画取挂秋堂，与尔爲邻有深意。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45596.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45596","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}